## What to deliver

Build the interceptor up operation by operation until the model in `model.png`
matches the brief — a long fuselage tapering to a pointed nose at the front, a
cockpit canopy, forward-swept wings, and tail fins, cleanly symmetric about its
centerplane. **Before you finish, run `voxel render`** so the geometry (`mesh.glb`)
the result is built from is emitted — an unrendered model is scored as empty. When
you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
